# The night harbour walked past several lamps: the set of lamps with a VSM shadow changes as the hero goes
# ([INTERNAL] vsmLampShadows, reports/render-features/2026-11-05-vsm-mac-hard/README.md, «Тени ближних ламп»).
# The poor quarter's lane from PATH_04 to PATH_07 (≈15 m) between the Red Lantern and the huts: about ten torches
# and room lights within 6 m of the way. The camera follows behind.
# Run it with the variants side by side, e.g.:
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=960x540 BENCH_VID_RES=1 OPENGOTHIC_VSM=1 OPENGOTHIC_VSM_LAMP_SHADOWS=<N> scripts/bench.sh vsm-harbour-walk
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
set time 0 0
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_04
face wp NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_07
watch player
cam look 120
cam follow 450 180 170
walkmode walk
wait 10000
pos
shot harbour-walk-start
rec harbour-walk
walkto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_07
waitarrive 25000
wait 1000
stop
pos
shot harbour-walk-end
